[[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Open the retaining bands.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/244000463.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Air flow meter</p></td><td><p>K041</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Remove the air flow meter.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/244002879.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before fitting the air flow meter the air filter casing must be thoroughly cleaned where it is connected to the actual flow meter.</p></aside><p>- Place the air flow meter in position.</p><p>- Connect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/244000463.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>Air flow meter</p></td><td><p>K041</p></td></tr></table></div><p>- Tighten the retaining bands.</p>"]]